    "description": "Baltic Sea coast in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rerik\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Rerik\">Rerik</a> (Rostock district), seen from Schmiedeberg hill with sandy beach and beach chairs. On the right, part of the gable of the bakery and pastry shop Michael Graf; the view faces northeast. The shown coastal section is mostly located within the <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Landschaftsschutzgebiet_K%C3%BChlung\" title=\"Category:Landschaftsschutzgebiet Kühlung\">Kühlung</a> landscape protection area."
